// n26 — a union with two `default:` branches.
//
// CORBA 3.4 §7.4.1.4.4: at most one default. The rule and its fix hint have
// both existed since unions landed, and **no corpus file produced it** until
// 2026-08-25 — `n07` covers a repeated *label*, which is the neighbouring rule
// and a different diagnosis.
//
// omniidl 4.3.4, measured 2026-08-25:
//   Error in union 'Reading': 1 repeated union label
//
// (The oracle counts the second `default` as a repeated label rather than as a
// second default; the refusal is what agrees, not the wording.)
//
// 유니온의 `default:`는 하나뿐이다. n07은 라벨 중복이고 이것은 기본 분기 중복으로,
// 서로 다른 진단이다.
module n26 {
  union Reading switch (long) {
    case 1: long sample;
    default: long fallback;
    default: long spare;
  };
};
